%% Sequence Diagram - Admin Dashboard real-time
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Admin
    participant AV as AdminActivity
    participant VM as AdminViewModel
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant LD as LiveData

    A->>AV: Mở AdminActivity
    AV->>VM: startListening()
    VM->>FS: addSnapshotListener("orders")
    VM->>FS: addSnapshotListener("users")

    loop Mỗi khi có thay đổi
        FS-->>VM: snapshot orders
        FS-->>VM: snapshot users
        VM->>VM: calculateOrderStats()
        Note over VM: – COD: chỉ tính khi DELIVERED/COMPLETED<br/>– VNPAY: tính khi PAID<br/>– Doanh thu thực = revenue – refund
        VM->>LD: postValue(totalRevenue, pending, ...)
        LD-->>AV: observe → cập nhật 9 tile
    end
